OL,3,GNEWSAGarvaghy Road residents fail in
OL,4,Abid to challenge Drumcree decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Garvaghy Road residents have failed
OL,7,Fin a bid to challenge the Parades
OL,8,FCommission's decision to allow the
OL,9,FDrumcree parade to walk down the
OL,10,Fpredominantly nationalist road, the
OL,11,FCourt of Appeal has ruled.
OL,13,FJudges said their decision was confined
OL,14,Fto the lawfulness of the decision - it
OL,15,Fwas not deciding whether or not the
OL,16,Fmarch should occur.
OL,18,FLady Chief Justice Dame Siobhan Keegan
OL,19,Fsaid the ruling was decided before the
OL,20,Fsecretary of state banned the parade on
OL,21,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
